.TH HI 1
.SH NAME
hi \- local-first terminal AI assistant
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B hi
.RI [ COMMAND ]
.SH DESCRIPTION
Chat with an OpenAI-compatible provider from the terminal. Commands proposed by
the assistant require explicit approval before execution.
.SH COMMANDS
.TP
.B hi config
Configure provider, credentials, endpoint, and model.
.TP
.B hi sessions
List saved sessions.
.TP
.B hi resume ID
Resume a saved session.
.TP
.B hi models
List models exposed by the configured provider.
.TP
.B hi completions SHELL
Generate shell completion script for bash, zsh, fish, or powershell.
.SH FILES
.IP ~/.config/hi/config.env
Provider configuration. API keys are stored in the operating system credential store and a protected 0600 fallback file.
.IP ~/.local/share/hi/sessions.db
Local conversation database.
